From: pVisor maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] fuse: isolate immutable lower data pages from namespace inodes

Negotiate fixed-size OPEN receipts and stable lower object IDs. Keep native
fh/nodeid and namespace identity. Use reclaimable data inodes and backing
files for read/splice/mmap without retaining closed host handles for cached
pages, sharing upper pages, or changing namespace EOF from lower reads.

diff --git a/fs/fuse/file.c b/fs/fuse/file.c
